00:11:58.680 --> 00:12:00.060
Five: Real estate.

00:12:02.220 --> 00:12:06.600
Investing in real estate can provide&nbsp;
long-term growth and income potential,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:06.600 --> 00:12:12.240
