00:12:17.700 --> 00:12:22.980
This category includes investments like&nbsp;
commodities, cryptocurrencies, and hedge funds.&nbsp;

00:12:23.880 --> 00:12:28.980
Alternative investments can provide&nbsp;
diversification and potentially high returns,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:28.980 --> 00:12:33.180
